  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/TamboradaTales.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;associaci&oacute; cultural Tambors i Bombos de Tales ha organitzat aquest dissabte la tradicional tamborada, a la qual han acudit agrupacions de tota la prov&iacute;ncia de Castell&oacute;, que han acabat actuant a la pla&ccedil;a de l&#39;Olivera.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0539.jpg\" alt=\"img_0539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0541.jpg\" alt=\"img_0541\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0543.jpg\" alt=\"img_0543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0545.jpg\" alt=\"img_0545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0546.jpg\" alt=\"img_0546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0547.jpg\" alt=\"img_0547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0552.jpg\" alt=\"img_0552\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0553.jpg\" alt=\"img_0553\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/trobadatamboretersibombostales18/img_0554.jpg\" alt=\"img_0554\" style=\"max